  "title": "InferOps V1 operator runbook, v1alpha1",
  "description": "The incidents a V1 operator is given a procedure for, as data. Each one records how it is detected, what a caller experiences, whether anything recovers it without a person, what a person has to do, how the recovery is confirmed, and where the procedure stops being reliable, with the evidence label of what stands behind it. Each alert in the alert record is routed to one section of the runbook, and each figure the runbook quotes is read back from the record it came from. Nothing here has been run as a drill by an operator following the page.",
  "documentRef": "docs/environment/operator-runbook.md",
